                    "sense_definition": "Present participle and gerund of <w>reassure</w>.",
                    "learner_level": "B2",
                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "comforting",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "She spent the afternoon <w>reassuring</w> her nervous child before the first day of school.",
